<mxfile host="drawio" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="02-registrar-atendimento" name="02-registrar-atendimento"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\nskinparam component {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    BorderColor #2C3E50\n    ArrowColor #2C3E50\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Psicólogo\&quot; as User #0B4A6A\ncomponent \&quot;WebFrontend\&quot; as Tela #BE2C2E\ncomponent \&quot;AtendimentoAppService\&quot; as Control #87A446\ncomponent \&quot;MySQLRepository\&quot; as Repo #E76F26\ncomponent \&quot;Agendamento\&quot; as Agend #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Atendimento\&quot; as Atend #5B9BD5\ncomponent \&quot;Evolução Clínica\&quot; as Evolucao #5B9BD5\n\nUser -right-&gt; Tela : 1. selecionarAgendamento() / informarDadosAvulsos()\\n2. [opt] escreverEvolução()\nTela -right-&gt; Control : 1.1. processarAtendimento() / processarAtendimentoAvulso()\\n2.1. [opt] adicionarEvolução()\n\nControl -down-&gt; Repo : 1.1.1. [prévio] buscar()\\n1.1.3. [prévio] salvar(Agendamento)\\n1.1.6. salvar(Atendimento)\\n2.1.3. [opt] salvar(Evolução)\n\nControl -up-&gt; Agend : 1.1.2. [prévio] registrarRealização()\nControl -up-&gt; Atend : 1.1.4. &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\\n1.1.5. registrarRealização()\nControl -right-&gt; Evolucao : 2.1.1. [opt] &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\\n2.1.2. [opt] registrar(conteúdo)\n\n@enduml&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;}" id="uml"><mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1514" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>